{"speciesId":526,"names":{"fr":"Gigalithe","es":"Gigalith","en":"Gigalith","ja":"ギガイアス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il comprime de l’énergie dans son corps, et ses attaques sont assez puissantes pour renverser des montagnes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Compressing the energy from its internal core lets it fire off an attack capable of blowing away a mountain."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il amplifie dans son corps l’énergie du soleil absorbée par ses cristaux orangés et la projette par la bouche."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The solar energy absorbed by its body’s orange crystals is magnified internally and fired from its mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The solar rays it absorbs are processed in its energy core and fired as a ball of light."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The solar rays it absorbs are processed in its energy core and fired as a ball of light."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il amplifie dans son noyau l’énergie du soleil absorbée par son corps et la projette en une boule de lumière."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Absorbe los rayos solares, procesa esa energía en su núcleo y lanza poderosas bolas de luz a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The solar rays it absorbs are processed in its energy core and fired as a ball of light."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"取りこんだ 太陽光線を エネルギーコアで 反応 させて 光の玉として 撃ちだしてくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il comprime de l’énergie dans son corps, et ses attaques sont assez puissantes pour renverser des montagnes."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"El núcleo de su cuerpo comprime la energía para lanzar ataques capaces de destruir una montaña."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Compressing the energy from its internal core lets it fire off an attack capable of blowing away a mountain."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体内の コアで エネルギーを 圧縮して 撃ち出す 攻撃は 山を 吹き飛ばす 威力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il amplifie dans son noyau l’énergie du soleil absorbée par son corps et la projette en une boule de lumière."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Absorbe los rayos solares, procesa esa energía en su núcleo y lanza poderosas bolas de luz a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The solar rays it absorbs are processed in its energy core and fired as a ball of light."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"取りこんだ 太陽光線を エネルギーコアで 反応 させて 光の玉として 撃ちだしてくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il comprime de l’énergie dans son corps, et ses attaques sont assez puissantes pour renverser des montagnes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"El núcleo de su cuerpo comprime la energía para lanzar ataques capaces de destruir una montaña."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Compressing the energy from its internal core lets it fire off an attack capable of blowing away a mountain."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体内の コアで エネルギーを 圧縮して 撃ち出す 攻撃は 山を 吹き飛ばす 威力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il absorbe les rayons solaires pour tirer des balles d’énergie incroyablement destructrices. Une arme inutilisable s’il pleut ou s’il fait nuit."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Absorbe los rayos solares y los transforma en poderosas bolas de energía. Sin embargo, no puede hacerlo de noche o en días lluviosos."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"The blasts of energy it makes from sunbeams have terrifying power. However, it’s not able to fire its blasts at night or on rainy days."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"太陽光線から つくりだす エネルギー弾は 凄い 威力。 ただ 夜や 雨の日は 撃てない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ce Pokémon jouit d’une force physique hors-norme, ce qui fait de lui le meilleur allié des chefs de chantier."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"La soberbia potencia de la que hace gala lo convierte en un ayudante idóneo para todo trabajador de la construcción."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Known for its hefty horsepower, this Pokémon is a popular partner for construction workers."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"かなりの 馬力を 持っているので 建設関係者が 好んで パートナーに 選ぶ ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"D’innombrables fissures se dessinent à la surface de son corps lorsqu’il déchaîne toute son énergie."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cuando dispara energía con todas sus fuerzas, la potencia es tal que le provoca incontables fisuras por todo el cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"When it fires off energy with all its might, the power creates countless fissures on its body."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"全力で エネルギーを 撃つと その パワーで 自分の 身体に 無数の 亀裂が はしる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il peut absorber les rayons du soleil et les rejeter sous forme d’énergie, mais il se cache généralement au plus profond de la terre."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Absorbe los rayos de sol y los expulsa en forma de energía. Suele ocultarse en las profundidades subterráneas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It absorbs rays of sunlight and shoots out energy. It’s usually lurking deep beneath the surface."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"太陽 光線を 吸収し エネルギーを 撃ち出す。 普段は 地中深くに 身を潜めている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Sa robustesse lui vaut parfois de travailler sur les chantiers et dans les carrières en compagnie des Hommes et des Pachyradjah."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su robustez le permite colaborar con humanos y Copperajah en labores de construcción y minería."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This hardy Pokémon can often be found on construction sites and in mines, working alongside people and Copperajah."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"たくましいので 工事現場や 採掘場で ダイオウドウや 人と 働いて いることも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il est capable d’envoyer des boules d’énergie assez puissantes pour balayer un camion-benne, mais il ne peut tirer que les jours ensoleillés."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Las bolas de energía que lanza solo en días soleados son tan potentes que pueden hacer saltar un camión por los aires."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Although its energy blasts can blow away a dump truck, they have a limitation— they can only be fired when the sun is out."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"晴れた 日に しか 撃てないが エネルギー弾の 破壊力は ダンプカーも 吹きとばすほど。"}],"varieties":[{"id":526,"moves":[{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",7],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",7],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",7],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",7],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",10],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",10],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",10],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",10],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",10],[20,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"strength","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,